{"id":"torrey:edomites-the","source":"torrey","name":"Edomites, The","slug":"edomites-the","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Descended from Esau — Ge 36:9.","refs":[["Gen",36,9,36,9]]},{"text":"Dwelt in Mount Seir — Ge 32:3; De 2:4,5.","refs":[["Gen",32,3,32,3],["Deut",2,4,2,4],["Deut",2,5,2,5]]},{"text":"Children of Esau. — De 2:4.","refs":[["Deut",2,4,2,4]]},{"text":"Brethren of Israel. — Nu 20:14.","refs":[["Num",20,14,20,14]]},{"text":"Governed by dukes — Ge 36:15-30,40-43; Ex 15:15.","refs":[["Gen",36,15,36,30],["Gen",36,40,36,43],["Exod",15,15,15,15]]},{"text":"Afterwards had kings — Ge 36:31-29; Nu 20:14.","refs":[["Gen",36,31,36,39],["Num",20,14,20,14]]},{"text":"Under a deputy or viceroy while subject to Judah — 1Ki 22:47.","refs":[["1Kgs",22,47,22,47]]},{"text":"Wise. — Jer 49:7.","refs":[["Jer",49,7,49,7]]},{"text":"Proud and self-confident. — Jer 49:16; Ob 1:3.","refs":[["Jer",49,16,49,16],["Obad",1,3,1,3]]},{"text":"Strong and cruel. — Jer 49:19.","refs":[["Jer",49,19,49,19]]},{"text":"Vindictive. — Eze 25:12.","refs":[["Ezek",25,12,25,12]]},{"text":"Idolatrous. — 2Ch 25:14,20.","refs":[["2Chr",25,14,25,14],["2Chr",25,20,25,20]]},{"text":"Superstitious. — Jer 27:3,9.","refs":[["Jer",27,3,27,3],["Jer",27,9,27,9]]},{"text":"Carried on extensive commerce — Eze 27:20.","refs":[["Ezek",27,20,27,20]]},{"text":"Specially given to them. — De 2:5.","refs":[["Deut",2,5,2,5]]},{"text":"Fertile and rich. — Ge 27:39.","refs":[["Gen",27,39,27,39]]},{"text":"Mountainous and rocky. — Jer 49:16; Mal 1:3.","refs":[["Jer",49,16,49,16],["Mal",1,3,1,3]]},{"text":"Traversed by roads. — Nu 20:17.","refs":[["Num",20,17,20,17]]},{"text":"Well fortified. — Ps 60:9.","refs":[["Ps",60,9,60,9]]},{"text":"Called Mount Seir. — Eze 35:2.","refs":[["Ezek",35,2,35,2]]},{"text":"Called Mount of Esau. — Ob 1:21.","refs":[["Obad",1,21,1,21]]},{"text":"Called Dumah. — Isa 21:11.","refs":[["Isa",21,11,21,11]]},{"text":"Called Idumea. — Isa 34:6; Mr 3:8.","refs":[["Isa",34,6,34,6],["Mark",3,8,3,8]]},{"text":"Called Edom. — Isa 63:1.","refs":[["Isa",63,1,63,1]]},{"text":"Dinhabah or Dedan. — Ge 36:32; Jer 49:8.","refs":[["Gen",36,32,36,32],["Jer",49,8,49,8]]},{"text":"Avith. — Ge 36:35.","refs":[["Gen",36,35,36,35]]},{"text":"Pau. — Ge 36:39.","refs":[["Gen",36,39,36,39]]},{"text":"Bozrah. — Jer 49:22; Am 1:12.","refs":[["Jer",49,22,49,22],["Amos",1,12,1,12]]},{"text":"Teman. — Jer 49:7; Eze 25:13.","refs":[["Jer",49,7,49,7],["Ezek",25,13,25,13]]},{"text":"Eziongeber, a sea port. — 1Ki 9:26.","refs":[["1Kgs",9,26,9,26]]},{"text":"Implacable enemies of Israel — Eze 35:5.","refs":[["Ezek",35,5,35,5]]},{"text":"Israel forbidden to hate — De 23:7.","refs":[["Deut",23,7,23,7]]},{"text":"Israel forbidden to spoil — De 2:4,6; 2Ch 20:10.","refs":[["Deut",2,4,2,4],["Deut",2,6,2,6],["2Chr",20,10,20,10]]},{"text":"Might be received into the congregation in third generation — De 23:8.","refs":[["Deut",23,8,23,8]]},{"text":"Refused Israel a passage — Nu 20:21; Jdj 11:17.","refs":[["Num",20,21,20,21],["Judg",11,17,11,17]]},{"text":"Saul made war against — 1Sa 14:47.","refs":[["1Sam",14,47,14,47]]},{"text":"David subdued, &c — 2Sa 8:14; 1Ch 18:11,13.","refs":[["2Sam",8,14,8,14],["1Chr",18,11,18,11],["1Chr",18,13,18,13]]},{"text":"Slaughter of, by Joab and Abishai — 1Ki 11:16; 1Ch 18:12.","refs":[["1Kgs",11,16,11,16],["1Chr",18,12,18,12]]},{"text":"Took refuge in Egypt — 1Ki 11:17-19.","refs":[["1Kgs",11,17,11,19]]},{"text":"Returned after David’s death — 1Ki 11:21-22.","refs":[["1Kgs",11,21,11,22]]},{"text":"Were stirred up against Solomon — 1Ki 11:14.","refs":[["1Kgs",11,14,11,14]]},{"text":"Confederated with enemies of Israel against Jehoshaphat — 2Ch 20:10; Ps 83:4-6.","refs":[["2Chr",20,10,20,10],["Ps",83,4,83,6]]},{"text":"Miraculous overthrow of — 2Ch 20:22.","refs":[["2Chr",20,22,20,22]]},{"text":"Revolted from Joram, king of Judah — 2Ki 8:20-22; 2Ch 21:8-10.","refs":[["2Kgs",8,20,8,22],["2Chr",21,8,21,10]]},{"text":"Re-conquered by Amaziah — 2Ki 14:7,10; 2Ch 25:11,12.","refs":[["2Kgs",14,7,14,7],["2Kgs",14,10,14,10],["2Chr",25,11,25,11],["2Chr",25,12,25,12]]},{"text":"The Jews ensnared by the idols of, and punished — 2Ch 25:14,15,20.","refs":[["2Chr",25,14,25,14],["2Chr",25,15,25,15],["2Chr",25,20,25,20]]},{"text":"Rebelled against Ahaz — 2Ch 28:17.","refs":[["2Chr",28,17,28,17]]},{"text":"Aided Babylon against Judah — Ps 137:7; Ob 1:11.","refs":[["Ps",137,7,137,7],["Obad",1,11,1,11]]},{"text":"Subjection to Israel. — Ge 25:23; 27:29,37.","refs":[["Gen",25,23,25,23],["Gen",27,29,27,29],["Gen",27,37,27,37]]},{"text":"Revolt from Israel. — Ge 27:40.","refs":[["Gen",27,40,27,40]]},{"text":"Israel’s occupation of their country. — Nu 24:18; Ob 1:17-19.","refs":[["Num",24,18,24,18],["Obad",1,17,1,19]]},{"text":"To share in the punishment of the nations. — Jer 9:26; 25:15-27; Eze 32:29.","refs":[["Jer",9,26,9,26],["Jer",25,15,25,27],["Ezek",32,29,32,29]]},{"text":"Punishment for persecuting Israel. — Isa 34:5-8; 63:1-4; La 4:21; Eze 25:13,14; Am 1:11,12; Ob 1:10,15.","refs":[["Isa",34,5,34,8],["Isa",63,1,63,4],["Lam",4,21,4,21],["Ezek",25,13,25,13],["Ezek",25,14,25,14],["Amos",1,11,1,11],["Amos",1,12,1,12],["Obad",1,10,1,10],["Obad",1,15,1,15]]},{"text":"Exterminating slaughter of. — Ob 1:18.","refs":[["Obad",1,18,1,18]]},{"text":"Utter desolation of their country. — Isa 34:9-17; Eze 35:7-15.","refs":[["Isa",34,9,34,17],["Ezek",35,7,35,15]]},{"text":"The king of Babylon an instrument of their punishment. — Jer 27:3-6.","refs":[["Jer",27,3,27,6]]},{"text":"Israel an instrument of their punishment. — Eze 25:14; Ob 1:18.","refs":[["Ezek",25,14,25,14],["Obad",1,18,1,18]]},{"text":"Their ruin to be an astonishment. — Jer 49:17,21.","refs":[["Jer",49,17,49,17],["Jer",49,21,49,21]]},{"text":"Their future subjection to the Jews. — Isa 11:14; Am 9:12.","refs":[["Isa",11,14,11,14],["Amos",9,12,9,12]]},{"text":"Doeg. — 1Sa 22:18.","refs":[["1Sam",22,18,22,18]]},{"text":"Hadad. — 1Ki 11:14,19.","refs":[["1Kgs",11,14,11,14],["1Kgs",11,19,11,19]]},{"text":"Eliphaz. — Job 2:11.","refs":[["Job",2,11,2,11]]}],"refCount":107}
